id: greedy-rabbit-sixth-effect
name: 6th effect of Greedy Rabbit
type: outOfSequence
actionCost: 0
kiCost: 0
attacking: false
requiresTarget: false
usageLimit: 1/encounter
fromTrait: greedy-rabbit
fromEffect: 6
source: Core Rule
description: >
  Greedy Rabbit's sixth effect, once an Encounter: a Clash (Cognitive/Morale) at a targeted Opponent - won, they enter the Sleeping Combat Condition.
text: >
  (6)-[Triggered, 1/Encounter]: Target an Opponent. Make a Clash (Cognitive/Morale) against that Opponent. If you win, they enter the Sleeping Combat Condition.

---

# "[Triggered]" with no trigger named: whenever the player chooses - out of sequence, no Action (chat.mjs greedySleep).
[on used]
greedySleep();
